# --- Private-tooling playbooks and their tests (E50_S13, user decision 2026-09-10) ---
# brainstorm-to-mirror terminates in `mirror-public`, a deliberately private skill blocklisted
# above in BOTH its bare and j- form. No step-name cutover can make this playbook load in the
# public mirror, because skills/j-mirror-public/SKILL.md is never shipped there — load-playbooks.sh
# requires every step's skills/<dir>/SKILL.md to exist or it skips the whole playbook. Rather than
# publish mirror-public or swap the terminal step for a public skill, the playbook itself is
# private tooling and is blocklisted. The loader's skip behaviour was never the defect.
skills/jenga/playbooks/brainstorm-to-mirror.json
