# applies to this entry. It is left in place only because E50_S20_T02 owns both of these test
# entries and their visible-skip conversion; unblocking it is that task's call, not this one's.
tests/load-playbooks-composition.bats

# --- E76 Per-Task Token Accounting is private tooling (user decision, 2026-10-16) ---
# Every E76-owned file is blocklisted so it never reaches the public mirror. The tests and fixtures
# follow their subject out per the "a test may never outlive its subject" rule at the top of this file.
# Caveat: E76 also edits files that DO ship (skills/j-close-story/SKILL.md, the looping skills,
# templates/SCRUM_BOARD_SCHEMA.md, the dashboard under project/app). Those edits cannot be hidden by a
# path blocklist, so E76 epic decision 6 requires them to treat a missing task-usage.sh as a silent
