# --- Long-running tests, kept private-side (see project/rapports/problems/E77-long-running-tests-in-the-shipping-suite.md) ---
# Each file below took 50 seconds or more on its own (130, 99, 78, 73, 59, 58 and 52 seconds, measured one file at a time on a
# quiet machine), and together they add about nine minutes to the test-subject-invariant gate that /mirror-public runs before
# every real push. They are verified on the private side. This is a stop-gap list of the files measured so far, not a complete
# one: the rest of the suite has not been timed.
tests/workflow-render-artifact.bats
tests/workflow-artifacts-e2e.bats
tests/workflow-run-compute.bats
tests/workflow-dispatch-compute-render.bats
tests/workflow-outputs.bats
tests/workflow-compute-registry.bats
tests/workflow-pause-resume.bats
